<title>UK: Deutsche Bank sets zero coupon 1.0 trln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets zero coupon 1.0 trln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following zero coupon bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK NEDERLANDS BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 TRLN LIRE COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    15.OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  7.357     PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.10	REOFFER    7.357     YIELD	 9.09 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50    SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
